<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Growth Experiment {{ experiment_id }} — {{ product_name }}</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h1>Growth Experiment {{ experiment_id }} — {{ product_name }}</h1>
<h2>Hypothesis</h2>
<p>If we &lt;change&gt; for &lt;segment&gt;, then {{ metric_name }} will change by at least &lt;minimum_effect_pct&gt; percent because &lt;mechanism&gt;.</p>
<ul><li>change: &lt;one change&gt;</li><li>segment: &lt;one segment&gt;</li><li>primary_metric: {{ metric_name }} (a measured rate, never &quot;engagement&quot;)</li><li>minimum_effect_pct: &lt;number above 0&gt;</li><li>mechanism: &lt;the belief this test can prove wrong&gt;</li></ul>
<h2>Guardrails (at least three, one per category; a breach vetoes a ship)</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>name</th><th>category</th><th>stop_threshold</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>&lt;metric&gt;</td><td>revenue_or_conversion</td><td>&lt;threshold versus control&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>&lt;metric&gt;</td><td>retention</td><td>&lt;threshold versus control&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>&lt;metric&gt;</td><td>performance_or_error</td><td>&lt;threshold&gt;</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>ICE (integers 1-10, scored before build against the written criteria)</h2>
<ul><li>impact: &lt;1-10&gt;</li><li>confidence: &lt;1-10; at most 3 unless confidence_evidence cites a prior test, research or analytics&gt;</li><li>ease: &lt;1-10&gt;</li><li>criteria_ref: &lt;path to the team's ICE criteria&gt;</li><li>confidence_evidence: &lt;citation, or null&gt;</li><li>backlog_rank: &lt;position; deviations from ICE order are logged&gt;</li></ul>
<h2>Sample size (alpha 0.05, power 0.8)</h2>
<ul><li>baseline_rate: &lt;rate over the last four closed weeks&gt;</li><li>minimum_detectable_effect_pct: &lt;same as the hypothesis&gt;</li><li>required_per_variant: &lt;from the power calculation&gt;</li><li>eligible_daily_traffic: &lt;users/day in the segment&gt;</li><li>duration_weeks: &lt;ceil(required_per_variant / (eligible_daily_traffic x smallest allocation) / 7), 1 to 8; above 8 redesign&gt;</li></ul>
<h2>Assignment (randomised_controlled, by the flag platform)</h2>
<ul><li>platform: &lt;launchdarkly | statsig | unleash | growthbook | optimizely | internal&gt;</li><li>hash_key: &lt;user_id | account_id&gt;</li><li>control_variant: &lt;variant receiving the unchanged experience&gt;</li></ul>
<table><thead><tr><th>variant</th><th>percent</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>control</td><td>&lt;n&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>&lt;variant&gt;</td><td>&lt;n&gt; (percentages sum to 100)</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Instrumentation</h2>
<ul><li>exposure_event: &lt;event fired when the user sees the variant&gt; (exposure_logged_at: variant_seen)</li><li>analytics_destination: &lt;where events land&gt;</li><li>metric_events: &lt;primary and guardrail events&gt;</li><li>playback: cohort &lt;staging | one_percent&gt;, performed_on &lt;YYYY-MM-DD&gt;, events_verified &lt;exposure and every metric event, each with experiment id and variant id&gt;; no ramp above the smoke-test allocation until passed</li></ul>
<h2>Schedule and SRM gate</h2>
<ul><li>launch_date: {{ start_date }}</li><li>stop_date: {{ end_date }} (at least duration_weeks whole weeks after launch; results are read only then)</li><li>sequential_method: &lt;null, or the method declared up front&gt;</li><li>srm_check: chi_square_p &lt;observed versus planned allocation&gt;; below 0.001 invalidates the run</li></ul>
<h2>Write-up (within seven days of stop_date, whatever the outcome)</h2>
<ul><li>date: &lt;YYYY-MM-DD&gt;</li><li>log_entry: &lt;shared experiment log reference&gt;</li><li>decision: &lt;ship | iterate | kill; never ship on a breached guardrail or a failed SRM check&gt;</li><li>primary_effect: observed &lt;x&gt; percent, CI &lt;low&gt; to &lt;high&gt;</li><li>guardrail_results: &lt;one line per guardrail with observed value and breached yes/no&gt;</li><li>srm_p: &lt;same as srm_check&gt;</li><li>belief_changed: &lt;one sentence on what the team now believes differently&gt;</li><li>counts_toward_velocity: &lt;true only once this write-up exists&gt;</li></ul>
</body></html>
